sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (customData = <customData>)
    CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (customData = customData, transactionInfo.customData = <customData>)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
